# Keeps this directory in the repository.
#
# docker-compose bind-mounts ./config to /config, where the editable settings
# file aniflow.yaml and the log (log/aniflow.log) live. If the directory is
# missing, Docker creates it and then chmods it - which some hosts (TrueNAS
# SCALE datasets with NFSv4 ACLs and aclmode=restricted) refuse with
# "operation not permitted", and the container never starts.
#
# The log/ subfolder is created by AniFlow itself and is deliberately not
# checked in.
